# SIMD Optimization for Audio DSP

## Overview

SIMD (Single Instruction Multiple Data) allows processing multiple audio samples simultaneously. This is critical for:
- Reducing CPU usage in real-time processing
- Enabling more complex DSP per voice
- Supporting higher sample rates and channel counts

## JUCE SIMDRegister

